  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  TextBox: {fileID: 2106531355}
  CharacterName: {fileID: 146079839}
  TemplateText: {fileID: 432816396}
  ZombieInfectedLines:
  - 'Could you describe to me what happened?

'
  - "I was sleeping in my car when a zombie broke the window and grabbed my leg.
    \r\n"
  - It dragged my leg out the car window and took a big bite out of my leg.
  - 'I kicked open the door and got away.

'
  - 'Then I found my way here.

'
  - 'I see, I''ll try my best.

'
  WerewolfInfectedLines:
  - Could you describe to me what happened?
  - I-I was eating with my friend!
  - There was this- uh- werewolf that came and-
  - My friend attacked it and told me to run for it-
  - "I-I\u2026 I left him."
  - I see, I'll try my best.
  VampireInfectedLines:
  - 'Could you describe to me what happened?

'
  - "\u2026"
  - I was scavenging.
  - ' A vampire bit me.'
  - I came here.
  - ...
  - I see, I'll try my best.
  ZombieSavedLines:
  - Thank you for the help! I don't know what I would've done without your assistance.
  - No problem, please go to our safe room, 206, for the time being.
  WerewolfSavedLines:
  - Thank you for the help, it was hard trying to control the infection.
  - No problem, please go to room 206 for the time being.
  VampireSavedLines:
  - Thank you very much for the assistance.
  - No problem, please go to room 206 for the time being.
  ZombieInfectedCharcterLines:
  - Doctor
  - Zane
  - Zane
  - Zane
  - Zane
  - Doctor
  WerewolfInfectedCharcterLines:
  - Doctor
  - Wade
